#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/oraclecloud/oracleCloud.rst:61
msgid ""
"Morpheus version 4.2.1 and higher support live costing data from the "
"Oracle Cloud metering API. In order to authenticate with this API, edit "
"your existing Oracle Cloud account integration or begin the process of "
"newly integrating an account that wasn’t previously consumable in "
