"your existente Oracle Cloud cuenta integration o begin el proceso of "
"newly integrating un cuenta que wasn’t previamente consumable in "
"|morpheus| (Infrastructure > Clouds > +ADD)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/oraclecloud/oracleCloud.rst:63
