" uses token-based authentication. We must access a Client ID and Client "
"Secret value from the Oracle Public Cloud console to complete these "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"En el advanced opciones sección of el add/edit cloud modal para Oracle "
"Public Cloud, el COSTING KEY y COSTING SECRET campos debe be completed to"
" work con metering API datos in |morpheus|. Unlike el OCI API "
"authentication used to initially integrate Oracle Cloud, el metering API "
"uses token-based authentication. We debe acceso un Client ID y Client "
"Secret valor desde el Oracle Public Cloud console to completo estos "
"campos."

